<title>CANADA: Canadian dollar ends virtually flat in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Canadian dollar ends virtually flat in thin trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3760/1.3770	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3752</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3680   SUPPORT 1.3820	HI 1.3765   LO  1.3755</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3760/70    HI 1.3780     EUROPE OPEN     1.3763</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3752/57    LO 1.3755     HI 1.3765   LO  1.3752</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar ended virtually flat at C$1.3765 (US$0.7264) in light trading on Monday due to holidays in the United States and Britain, traders said.</p>
<p>* U.S. markets were closed for the Memorial Day holiday, while London markets observed a bank holiday, holding the Canada dollar to a narrow range.</p>
